rp1c-depois-cartao-remuneracao-bruta-mensal-media-en-390.png: In the 2nd quarter of 2026, employees earned on average 1 835 euros a month (provisional data), before deductions and including holiday and Christmas pay, in the jobs declared to Social Security and to the civil-service pension fund; each person counts as many times as the jobs they hold. More than in the same quarter a year earlier.
