rp1c-depois-cartao-beneficiarios-do-rsi-por-mil-2024-en-390.png: In 2024 there were 24,22 people receiving social insertion income for every thousand people of working age, from 15 to 64 years old: it is Social Security’s support for people living in extreme poverty, with a programme of integration into work and the community. Fewer than in 2023.
